{"t":"FRT","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Federal Realty Investment Trust","ko":null,"sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Retail","employees":314,"hq":"North Bethesda, MD, United States","website":"https://www.federalrealty.com","summary_en":"Federal Realty Investment Trust is a recognized leader in the ownership, operation and redevelopment of high-quality retail-based properties located primarily in major coastal markets and select underserved regions with strong economic and demographic fundamentals. Federal Realty's mission is to deliver long-term, sustainable growth through investing in communities where retail demand exceeds supply. This includes a portfolio of open-air shopping centers and mixed-use destinationssuch as Santana Row, Pike & Rose, and Assembly Row, which together reflect the company's ability to create distinctive, high-performing environments that serve as vibrant destinations for their communities. Federal Realty's 103 properties include approximately 3,700 tenants in 28.8 million commercial square feet, and approximately 2,700 residential units. Federal Realty has increased its quarterly dividends to its shareholders for 59 consecutive years, the longest record in the REIT industry. Federal Realty Investment Trust is based in North Bethesda, Maryland. Federal Realty Investment Trust was incorporated in 1962 in Maryland.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"연방부동산투자신탁(Federal Realty Investment Trust)은 주로 주요 해안 시장과 탄탄한 경제 및 인구통계학적 기반을 갖춘 일부 소외된 지역에 위치한 고품질 소매 기반 부동산의 소유, 운영 및 재개발 부문에서 인정받는 선두업체입니다. Federal Realty의 사명은 소매 수요가 공급을 초과하는 지역사회에 투자하여 장기적이고 지속 가능한 성장을 제공하는 것입니다. 여기에는 야외 쇼핑 센터와 산타나 로우(Santana Row), 파이크 앤 로즈(Pike & Rose), 어셈블리 로우(Assembly Row)와 같은 복합 용도 목적지의 포트폴리오가 포함되며, 이는 지역 사회를 위한 활기 넘치는 목적지 역할을 하는 독특하고 높은 성과를 내는 환경을 만드는 회사의 능력을 함께 반영합니다. Federal Realty의 103개 부동산에는 2,880만 상업용 평방피트에 약 3,700명의 임차인과 약 2,700개의 주거용 건물이 포함되어 있습니다. Federal Realty는 REIT 업계에서 가장 긴 기록인 59년 연속 주주들에 대한 분기별 배당금을 늘렸습니다. Federal Realty Investment Trust는 메릴랜드 주 노스 베데스다에 본사를 두고 있습니다. 연방부동산투자신탁(Federal Realty Investment Trust)은 1962년 메릴랜드에서 설립되었습니다.","val":{"price":113.24,"mcap":9899251712.0,"pe":22.647999,"fpe":34.54893,"peg":null,"ps":7.3198204,"pb":3.1610093,"ev_ebitda":17.659,"div":4.1,"beta":0.952,"hi52":128.21,"lo52":95.0},"fin":{"rev":1352390016.0,"rev_g":0.053,"eps_g":0.069,"gross":0.68279,"op":0.34483,"net":0.32588002,"roe":0.12941,"fcf":436163744.0,"cash":121630000.0,"debt":4966979072.0,"de":141.6,"eps":5.0,"feps":3.27767},"own":{"short":0.00029999999,"inst":1.0198101,"insider":0.010980001},"analyst":{"n":19,"mean":126.94737,"median":125.0,"high":145.0,"low":115.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.89474,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":5,"buy":8,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":9,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":135.0,"priorPriceTarget":131.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-23","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":119.0,"priorPriceTarget":126.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-12","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":131.0,"priorPriceTarget":149.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-09","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":115.0,"priorPriceTarget":127.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-05","Firm":"Wells Fargo","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":126.0,"priorPriceTarget":134.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-28","Firm":"Barcl